  "definition": "Required Continuing Education",
  "effectiveDate": "2020-02-06",
  "historyNote": "#9672, eff 4-2-10; ss by #12507, INTERIM, eff 4-2-18, EXPIRED: 10-1-18 New. #12635, eff 10-2-18; ss by #12988, eff 2-6-20",
